  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change Campaign 2011 - 2014 - Climate Change Campaign</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Climate Change Campaign 2011 - 2014</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kampanjens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r                                                        att &#xf6;ka medvetenheten om fr&#xe5;gor som ber&#xf6;r klimatf&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndringar,         att &#xe4;ndra det kollektiva och enskilda beteendet ifr&#xe5;ga om vanor    och konsumtionsm&#xf6;nster;                                                  att fr&#xe4;mja konsumenternas efterfr&#xe5;gan p&#xe5; socialt ansvarsfull       tillverkning och industri f&#xf6;r att minimera milj&#xf6;p&#xe5;verkan;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The campaign&apos;s objectives are                                          &quot; to raise awareness of the issues which affect climate change;       &quot; to change behaviour of collective and individual practices and     patterns of consumption;                                               &quot; to encourage consumer demand for socially responsible              manufacturing and industry to minimize environmental impact;</narrative>
  </description>
